  "x-cross-field-constraints": [
    "All paths are absolute canonical UTF-8 paths without NUL; controller enforces canonical parent/no symlink and O_NOFOLLOW for final file components.",
    "CLI --artifact-root equals directories.artifact_root.path. Deployment, session_dir and temporary_dir are strict descendants; temporary_dir is exactly artifact_root/tmp.",
    "Parent validates artifact_root mtime before creating logs. Frontend intentionally skips only artifact_root mtime, then retains realpath/dev/inode/mode0700; all other directory mtime checks remain.",
    "session_dir and temporary_dir are precreated empty0700. profile is0700 outside artifact_root. cwd is a private non-Git directory without .prime.",
    "environment.exact is the root v2 eight-entry parent environment. Optional bounded Darwin __CF_USER_TEXT_ENCODING is post-import runtime metadata only and never a deployment entry.",
    "kernel invocation_path is the venv symlink path; invocation_link, resolved_target and pyvenv_cfg are all independently verified.",
    "No auth or provider credential field exists. Controller never opens auth.json. Root externally validates all closure manifest member bytes before import.",
    "model_tokens_between_turns is the native per-phase setting only. Root campaign budget is120000 total across both contexts and never resets."
  ]
